culuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_1232178115164036_3852889755500363950_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J0HCKF2cG8EQ7kNvwFOkvX7&_nc_oc=AdpwqIuavdtGnZHcwB5ZXEfe3g2JL7DGXPQHdvDubvIxLVJ-2DVYnJlNFcRO64A-43Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ12AM7LlrinUMOXfVL6y4_8i_9DYfJdiJQ558dmeuilg&oe=6AFDD953"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Formula X Car Racing 1F Championship", "keywords": ["GrandPrix", "Motorsport", "FormulaRacing", "RacingGame", "VRRacing"], "long_description": "Get ready for the ultimate racing experience in Formula X Car Racing 1F Championship! \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8\nStep into the driver\u2019s seat and feel the adrenaline as you speed through challenging tracks, tight corners, and high-speed straights. Master your Formula X car, push your limits, and compete to become the 1F Racing Champion!\nKey Features:\n\u26a1 High-Speed Racing Action: Drift, boost, and overtake like a pro.\n\ud83c\udfc6 1F Championship Mode: Compete in multiple circuits to claim the ultimate title.\n\ud83d\ude97 Customizable Formula Cars: Upgrade engines, tires, and aerodynamics for peak performance.\n\ud83c\udf0d Multiple Tracks & Environments: City streets, mountains, and high-tech racing arenas.\n\ud83c\udfae Arcade & Competitive Gameplay: Perfect for casual fun and hardcore racing fans alike.\n\ud83c\udfa8 Stunning Graphics & Realistic Physics: Feel the speed like never before!\nWhether you\u2019re a casual racer or a professional speedster, Formula X Car Racing 1F Championship delivers heart-pounding excitement at every turn. Are you ready to dominate the track and become a legend?", "short_description": "Race at top speed in Formula X Car Racing 1F Championship \u2013 be the ultimate racing legend!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonsgames-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_u